              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ntayu erubata e lelo anterera linono ooing'uaa enkurma to lari ake ninye pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te dukuya Olaitoriani Enkai ino, teine wueji negelu ninye, pee eitamany enkarna enye, nilo iyie ainos ina rubata e nkurma ino; o enoo sabibu linono, o eneilata ino, o enoo lkikaunot loo nkishu inono o ntare; pee iyiolou iyie aturia OlaitorianiEnkai ino anaake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenaa keado enkoitoi te iyie, neaku mindim ayau ina rubata tenikimayian Olaitoriani Enkai ino te nkaraki kelakua oleng te iyie ine wueji negelu Olaitoriani Enkai ino pee epik enkarna enye ine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbelekenya naa metaa mpisai, nieniki nena pisai enkaina ino, nilo ine wueji negelu Olaitoriani Enkai ino, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninyang'unye nena pisai entoki pooki naba anaa eniyieu, olkiteng aashu enker, enaisho oo sabibu aashu enaisho napi, entoki ake ninye naba anaa eniyieu; nilo iyie ainos teine te dukuya Olaitoriani Enkai ino ning'ida, iyie o lmarei lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niminturaa iyie ilo tung'ani loo Lawi otii atua nkang'itie inyi, amu meeta ninye erubata aashu enjung'ore tenebo iyie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
