          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te nkiting'oto, e pooki ari liokuni nkatitin pooki niyauu intae ematua ina rubata pooki e tomon enkisampuare inyi to lari obo, aairragie aashum too nkang'itie inyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore Olawi, enkaraki nemeeta ninye erubata aashu enjung'ore tenebo iyie, oilo omoni, o lokishi, o enkoliai natii atua nkang'itie inyi, nepuonu aainos neraposho; pee kitum Olaitoriani Enkai ino atamayiana teina siaai pooki oo nkaik inono nias.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
